
        Performance tips:

    Use React.memo to prevent unnecessary re-renders.
    Use useMemo and useCallback wisely.
    Lazy load components and split code.
    Use keys correctly in lists.
    Avoid inline functions and object creation in render.
    Keep components small and focuses.



    ** Remember

    Performance optimization is key in react application.
    Use the right tool and pattern for the right problem.
    Alaways profile your app and remove bottlenecks.